      "RefreshBankEnableable": "Reads current SwitchAllowed, only sets checkbox Enabled through ComponentEnabled, then virtual4 RefreshBankEnabled. Enabled is independent of Checked.",
      "core_effects": "Unequal HighLux/LowLux setters invoke bank callbacks that update block stored LightLevel1/2 through Lux2550ToByte. Under supplied 0..2550 input domain, setting High=2550 or Low=0 causes no secondary crossing correction.",
      "critical_order": "Each inactive bank clears its own flags before globally normalizing all banks. A later inactive bank can retain raw use flags when an earlier inactive bank globally normalizes it. The first inactive bank preserves thresholds unless independently changed; subsequent inactive banks may have opposite thresholds replaced before their flags clear.",
      "exact_equivalent_algorithm": "For i=0..7, if banks[i].Active false: set UseLow=false; set UseHigh=false; for j=0..7 apply current j.UseLow -> setHigh(2550), then j.UseHigh -> setLow(0). After i loop, run that global normalization once more.",
