      "global_handler": "One ascending bank loop: for the current bank UseLow=true sets HighLux=2550 at0xfc0d5a, then the same bank UseHigh=true sets LowLux=0 at0xfc0dca, before the bank index increments at0xfc0e03 and loops at0xfc0e09. Current flags are used regardless panel Enabled.",
